# What EAS uploads to build the Android app.
#
# EAS archives the whole repository from its root, and the app needs
# nothing outside mobile/. Without this file EAS falls back to the
# .gitignore files - but on Windows it fails to apply the ones in
# subfolders (it compares "ballot/" against "ballot\dist\..."), so the
# ballot's installers and mobile/'s signing keystore went up with every
# build. While this file exists, EAS reads no .gitignore at all, so
# everything that must stay home is listed here.

# Everything at the root except the app.
/*
!/mobile

# Inside the app: secrets, the keystore EAS already holds, build output.
/mobile/node_modules
/mobile/.expo
/mobile/dist
/mobile/android
/mobile/ios
/mobile/**/*.jks
/mobile/**/*.keystore
/mobile/**/*.p8
/mobile/**/*.p12
/mobile/**/*.pem
/mobile/**/.env*
!/mobile/**/.env.example
